ストを読んでくれてありがとう！", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@shakura02/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1878968, "client_id": 1839919, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9ae4ef4c/uploads/origins/c83080b2-acf4-4583-9450-7520fb14edfe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=904719083b73c475e73afca9311505c4", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9ae4ef4c/uploads/origins/c83080b2-acf4-4583-9450-7520fb14edfe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4814fbb35cdeb982142e86c2531030c3", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Please make a Shakura version of this. You can choose the colour scheme. I hope this is an easy commission for a birthday present <3\n\nreference: https://imgur.com/a/TNFS4kN", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@shakura02/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1878968, "client_id": 1839919, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c4ec911a/uploads/origins/cfeb813c-8523-483d-be6b-e757c91b405e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a595b8a9be792f57c08c7d6366fb9eb", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c4ec911a/uploads/origins/cfeb813c-8523-483d-be6b-e757c91b405e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c39fa1bceb7b1d64543f1d139b0f1e32", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Please draw in a pose similar to the image!\nhttps://imgur.com/a/Xpip8Dx", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acc